# Web

One screen. The only scenario string is `Entrevista de emprego — Tecnologia`.

- Call `http://127.0.0.1:8765`. The API key never appears in client code.
- Capture with `MediaRecorder`, POST the blob, play the returned audio.
- Keep React 18 and Vite. No UI library, account screen, scenario picker, or websocket.
